values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000008', 'en', null, 'Latin: Foundations', 'A beginner''s introduction to Latin, taught entirely in English: the sounds of classical Latin, how nouns take cases, the present tense and the verb sum, adjective agreement, and reading real sentences. Vocabulary and grammar are drawn from the open Wikibooks Latin textbook (CC BY-SA 4.0), and the course closes with Latin''s living legacy in English and the Romance languages.', null, 'foundations', 48, true, 'humanities', '{}')
